  "description": "A company stores sales data in Amazon S3 and uses Amazon Athena to query it. Business analysts need interactive charts and dashboards that they can share with executives. Which AWS capability should they use?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>문제 풀이</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 104</p><h1>문제 풀이</h1></div><strong>104 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"104번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:96%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q104\" data-question=\"Q104\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q104</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company stores sales data in Amazon S3 and uses Amazon Athena to query it. Business analysts need interactive charts and dashboards that they can share with executives. Which AWS capability should they use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q104\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Quick Sight (formerly Amazon QuickSight)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q104\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q104\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q104\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · Athena로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 데이터를 조회하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">Quick Sight</a>에서 이를 시각화해 대시보드를 게시·공유할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">QuickSight / Quick Sight</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q103/\">이전 문제 <b>Q103</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q105/\">다음 문제 <b>Q105</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
